  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into wedges and place on the lined oven tray. Add the BBQ spice blend and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly and bake until tender, 20-25 mins.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-659624d2b6e284551035bf8e-83c23d73.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain corn. Roughly chop cucumber.\n• Place a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn until charred, 4-5 mins.\n• In a large bowl, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Top with corn, cucumber and salad leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-659624d2b6e284551035bf8e-cdf3b49d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• When the wedges have 5 mins remaining, return frying pan to a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side. In the last min of cook time, add the honey and a splash of water, turning haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-659624d2b6e284551035bf8e-472243ba.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Season salad and toss to combine.\n• Divide wedges, haloumi and salad between plates.\n• Serve with mayonnaise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-659624d2b6e284551035bf8e-5d691a4d.jpeg"
    }
  ]
